#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0883 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a dataset, there is more than one value of COUNTRY for a given value of COUNTRYL, considering only those rows on which both variables are populated
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col COUNTRY type=Char
col COUNTRYL type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | USA | United States
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | CAN | Canada
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | USA | United States
---
